 "remarks": "Hidden behind gates and surrounded by 5.5 acres of pristine, rolling lawns, this extraordinary stone manor estate is a masterclass in old-world craftsmanship and cutting-edge modern innovation. Anchored by a separately deeded 2 acre lot with a guest house, the property presents rare flexibility and long-term value, perfectly suited for multi-generational living, guests, or future expansion. Originally constructed in 1927, the residence has been comprehensively reimagined and renovated from the inside out, preserving its architectural integrity while delivering a fully modernized, high-tech smart home experience. With all new systems, infrastructure, and finishes including new HVAC, electrical, plumbing, septic, irrigation, generator, propane tank, fencing, landscaping and all new mechanicals offering the confidence of new construction wrapped in timeless stone. Inside, over 7,000 square feet of refined living space unfolds with remarkable craftsmanship. Radiant heated floors span the first level, complemented by hand-selected reclaimed pumpkin wood, and museum-quality lighting throughout. The heart of the home is a striking new kitchen with soaring ceilings, custom concrete countertops, a bespoke island, and hand-selected bleu chinois tilework that adds depth and character throughout the first floor. Designed to entertain and inspire, the home also features an 800+ bottle wine cellar, a private fitness and training studio, and a beautifully appointed home office/library",
